{{PageBanner|Clb l 002 3 en.png|event}}
A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the fighting game known as '''Street Fighter''' (ストリートファイター, ''Sutorīto Faitā'', '''Street Fighter''') was originally held from November 11th, 2019 to November 15th, 2019. The collaboration includes [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event/Red Team Gacha Drop|exclusive]] [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event/Blue Team Gacha Drop|Gachas]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration the period.<br>
The game is published by [https://www.capcom.com Capcom].

==Event Information==
Are your Cats a match for these mighty fighters?<br>
The Street Fighter x The Battle Cats collab event is on,<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''January 9 (11:00AM) through January 26, 2026 (10:59AM)'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・New units in two Collab Capsule Sets!'''}}<br>
Aiming to be the best in the world, the fighters have arrived!<br>
New Uber Rare units {{Color|#0000FF|'''Juri (BLUE TEAM)'''}} and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cammy (RED TEAM)'''}} have been added along with Super Rare units {{Color|#33AAAA|'''Zangief Cat'''}} and {{Color|#FF9900|'''Jamie Cat'''}}!<br>
Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules to see the character lineup and their abilities!

※ The units shown above will be available only during this event. Please be aware that there is a chance that you may also collect non-collab characters from collab event banners.<br>
※ The units shown above will be available only from the collab banners at the Rare Capsules. Tap the banner at the top of the screen to switch between BLUE TEAM and RED TEAM capsules sets.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Battle the world's strongest fighters in limited collab stages!<br>
Street Fighter characters appear as enemies!<br>
Also, {{Color|#FF0000|'''all stages have had their clear rewards reset'''}}!<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this collab event to test your Cats at Street Fighter collab maps!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stage "Street Fighter"'''}}<br>
Travel the world in search of the strongest fighters! There are three difficulty levels to challenge: {{Color|#4EA72E|'''EASY'''}}, {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''NORMAL'''}}, and {{Color|#9900FF|'''HARD'''}}!

Clear these collab stages for a chance to earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''Ryu Cat, only available to collect during this event'''}}!<br>
Get a higher chance of earning Ryu Cat from later stages!

Also, {{Color|#4EA72E|'''stage rewards have been reset'''}}!<br>
Stage rewards are available to collect once again for anyone that has cleared these stages in a previous collab event!

※ Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.<br>
※ Ryu Cat can be unlocked from the Rare Unit section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to earn Ryu Cat as a drop reward upon Victory.<br>
※ You cannot collect Ryu Cat as a reward again if already earned from a previous event.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stage "New Challenger"'''}}<br>
New challengers have arrived!<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages at the times below during this collab event to test your Cats at the New Challenger collab map! New stages featuring {{Color|#9900FF|'''Juri'''}} and {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Cammy'''}} have been added!

{{Color|#FF0000|'''12:00AM - 1:59AM, 3:00AM - 4:59AM, 6:00AM - 7:59AM, 9:00AM - 10:59AM, 12:00PM - 1:59PM, 3:00PM - 4:59PM, 6:00PM - 7:59PM, 9:00PM - 10:59PM'''}}

The fighters shown below will appear randomly on the following days:<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Monday: Ryu, Blanka, Balrog, Cammy'''}}<br>
{{Color|#4EA72E|'''Tuesday: Chun-Li, Dhalsim, Vega, Juri'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0F9ED5|'''Wednesday: Guile, Ken, Sagat, Sakura'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''Thursday: Zangief, E. Honda, M. Bison, Luke'''}}<br>
{{Color|#E97132|'''Friday, Saturday, and Sunday feature ALL fighters'''}}, and with two stage difficulty levels each!

Defeat 4 fighters on any difficulty to face a {{Color|#9900FF|'''new, stronger challenger'''}}!<br>
Defeat this mysterious and powerful challenger for {{Color|#33AAAA|'''a chance to earn a limited unit'''}}!

※ Check the Event Calendar in the Cat Base to see the dates each stage will appear on.<br>
※ Use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to earn drop rewards upon Victory.<br>
※ You cannot collect limited units as rewards again if already earned from a previous event.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab Stage "Street Fighter - VERY HARD -"'''}}<br>
Street Fighter - VERY HARD - can be challenged after clearing a certain stage!<br>
Stand your ground and face down the strongest challengers!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・The "I Seek the Strongest" map is available in the Arena of Honor at the Catclaw Dojo!'''}}<br>
Who is the strongest fighter on Earth?!<br>
Test your skill against Street Fighter collab characters in collab-limited event stages!

Visit the Catclaw Dojo during this collab event to put your Cats to the test in the "{{Color|#FF0000|'''I Seek the Strongest'''}}" map!

Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players! Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn special rewards when your final high score determines your skill tier.<br>
Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
Take on the onslaught of fighters and aim for a high ranking!

※ Rewards may take a short time to be delivered after your final ranking tier is determined. Thanks for your patience!<br>
※ Your Ranking Result will be shown in the Catclaw Dojo, but rewards will be claimed by visiting the Mailbox menu from the Battle Cats title screen.<br>
※ Rewards will expire and become unclaimable 30 days after delivery.<br>
※ Network connection is required to play the Arena of Honor. Your score and ranking will be reset when the event ends.<br>
※ Accounts flagged for hacking or modding will have their Arena scores invalidated and may receive a playing ban.<br>
※ Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared before the Catclaw Dojo will be available to access.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Collab-limited Missions and Log-in Stamps available!'''}}<br>
Street Fighter 6 Collab Special Missions have been added to the Catnip Challenges!<br>
Clear limited Special missions to earn {{Color|#33AAAA|'''Cat Tickets'''}}!<br>
Limited log-in stamps are available during the collab event!<br>
Log in during the collab event to earn one stamp each day!<br>
Log in for 5 days to earn {{Color|#4EA72E|'''collab-limited Special unit Chun-Li Cat'''}}!<br>
Don't forget to log in each day to collect other useful item rewards!

※ Limited-time Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!<br>
※Once you have unlocked Chun-Li Cat, activate her by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※If you have earned Chun-Li Cat from a previous event, you will not be able to unlock her again.<br>
※ There are 17 log-in stamps for this event.

Check out the link below for more on Street Fighter 6!<br>
https://www.streetfighter.com/6/en-us/

